"If this is set to a non-empty string it is equivalent to specifying the B<-"
"B> option (don't try to write I<.pyc> files)."
msgstr ""

#: fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed debian-bookworm
#: opensuse-leap-16-0 archlinux debian-unstable mageia-cauldron
